codex
The mismatch is traced to anchor calculation. Python 3.12’s floating-point `sum` and Rust’s sequential sum produce slightly different values that cross an anchor-group boundary, changing R04’s later assignment. A diagnostic changing only Python’s sum method reproduces the native anchors and all 13 native actions. I’m recording that runtime-dependent discrepancy and finishing the custody and repository checks.

